    "nl": {
      "before": "",
      "after": "En ook mat.\n\n    Het commentaar van Ed van de\n     Gevel: “…a little mechanism whe-\n     re White needs 13 consecutive\n     checks, the  last one also being\n     mate.”",
      "beforeVariant": {
        "A": "1.Dxe2+? 1…Ka1, is remise.\n\nKa1? 2.Da7+ Da3 3.Dxa3 Kb1\n4.Da2+ Kc1 5.Dc2+ en mat.\n\n4… Kb2? 5.Dxe2+ Dd2 6.Dxd2+\nKb1 7.Da2+ Kc1 8.Dc2+ en mat.\n\nWeerom niet 5.Dxe2?, want dan\nkomt de zwarte dame in actie..",
        "B": "En mat."
      }
    }
  }
